# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Production build defaults — committed on purpose: no secrets here.
# Values set in Vercel's environment variables override this file.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# TEMPORARY: demo login on the live site, so the sign-in flow (Log in /
# Sign up, and signing in before See Results) can be previewed before
# real credentials exist. Any email signs in instantly; no account is
# created and nothing reaches a server. It switches itself off once real
# sign-in credentials are configured (lib/demo/config.mjs), and this
# file can then be deleted. See docs/AUTH-SETUP.md.
NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_AUTH=live
